# 11ty-reggietheroman

Read `AGENTS.md` for full architecture. Key points:

- Eleventy v3 + Handlebars + Tailwind v4 + DaisyUI (`coffee` theme)
- Layouts: `base.hbs` → `home.hbs` or `markdown.hbs`
- Collections: `tags: blogs` (blog posts), `tags: notes` (notes)
- Blog posts are single `.md` files at `src/blog/YYYY/MM/DD/slug.md` — no paired `.hbs`
- Notes render inline on `/notes/` — no detail pages
- CV content lives in `src/_content/cv/content.md` (excluded from 11ty via `.eleventyignore`)
- `pnpm start` for dev, `pnpm build` for production
- Output: `dist/`

When adding pages: update `nav.hbs` (mobile + desktop) and `src/static/sitemap.xml`.

Known issues and fix priorities: `systems-research/AGENT_FEEDBACK.md`.
